{"id":"n30837-1-8","stage":3,"title":"괜히 · 白白地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30837-1-8-1","ko":"너는 왜 잘못도 없는 나한테 짜증을 내는 거야?","zh":"你为什么无缘无故就对我发脾气啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못도","meaning":"连过错也……","explanation":"잘못（过错）＋도（也、连……也）；与后面的 없는 连用，表示“并没有做错什么”。","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62477","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못도","audio":"/audio/ef04d2afd52bc7548688.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有过错的","explanation":"없다（没有）＋-는（修饰名词）；잘못도 없는 修饰后面的 나（我），表示“没有做错事的我”。这里是状态，不是正在做的动作。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"13","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는","audio":"/audio/9064a5c0bfdea4101ee3.mp3"}},{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나한테","audio":"/audio/a650b718a38da6e97157.mp3"}},{"text":"짜증을","meaning":"不耐烦、脾气（宾语）","explanation":"짜증：烦躁、不耐烦；짜증을 내다 表示发脾气；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"짜증","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71579","senseId":"1","lemma":"짜증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짜증을","audio":"/audio/316ecdcc15363a9edbe2.mp3"}},{"text":"내는","meaning":"发脾气的","explanation":"내다：发、表现出不满（짜증을 내다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"13","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내는","audio":"/audio/a82b01c0eaf1dbfad884.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"……是怎么回事？","explanation":"거 是 것 的口语形式；-는 거야? 将前面的行为作为话题来追问或要求解释。本句带责问语气。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62477","definition":"做不好或做错的事。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有；本句指并无过错","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"没有；本句指并无过错","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"78dd3ebff92b1941","term":"짜증","zh":"烦躁、不耐烦；짜증을 내다 表示发脾气","audio":"/audio/78dd3ebff92b1941ec4a.mp3","entryId":"71579","definition":"烦躁、不耐烦；짜증을 내다 表示发脾气","pronunciation":["짜증"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"发、表现出不满（짜증을 내다）","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"发、表现出不满（짜증을 내다）","pronunciation":["내ː다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"것 的口语形式，使前面的内容名词化","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"것 的口语形式，使前面的内容名词化","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/c99973c69dd7e5e5a7f0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30837-1-8-2","ko":"미안. 내가 요즘 괜히 신경질이 나고 그러네.","zh":"对不起，我最近就是莫名地容易烦躁。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"미안.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","explanation":"미안：抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","readings":[{"term":"미안","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56257","senseId":"1","lemma":"미안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미안","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"괜히","meaning":"白白地，徒然，平白无故地","explanation":"괜히：白白地，徒然，平白无故地","readings":[{"term":"괜히","audio":"/audio/3f0c312f9083daae549b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30837","senseId":"1","lemma":"괜히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜히","audio":"/audio/3f0c312f9083daae549b.mp3"}},{"text":"신경질이","meaning":"烦躁、不耐烦（主语）","explanation":"신경질：容易烦躁、发脾气的状态；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"신경질","audio":"/audio/236d7d61177478d80608.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66150","senseId":"1","lemma":"신경질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"신경질이","audio":"/audio/b9b92a6df5127d583496.mp3"}},{"text":"나고","meaning":"感到烦躁，……","explanation":"나다：产生某种情绪；신경질이 나다 表示感到烦躁；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나고","audio":"/audio/6821e4b8d25d7394dceb.mp3"}},{"text":"그러네.","meaning":"总是这样呢","explanation":"그러다（那样做）＋-네（发现、感叹）；接在 -고 后概括前面说的烦躁情况，不是 그렇다 的“普通、一般”义。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러네","audio":"/audio/55f94fce65c9e23ec551.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ba804e5e1f459811","term":"미안","zh":"抱歉，愧疚，不好意思，过意不去","audio":"/audio/ba804e5e1f4598116ffc.mp3","entryId":"56257","definition":"由于做了对不起别人的事而觉得心里不舒坦、感到羞愧。","pronunciation":["미안"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"3f0c312f9083daae","term":"괜히","zh":"白白地，徒然，平白无故地","audio":"/audio/3f0c312f9083daae549b.mp3","entryId":"30837","definition":"没有特别的理由，华而不实地。","pronunciation":["괜ː히"]},{"id":"236d7d61177478d8","term":"신경질","zh":"容易烦躁、发脾气的状态","audio":"/audio/236d7d61177478d80608.mp3","entryId":"66150","definition":"容易烦躁、发脾气的状态","pronunciation":["신경질"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"产生某种情绪；신경질이 나다 表示感到烦躁","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生某种情绪；신경질이 나다 表示感到烦躁","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样做、处于前面所说的情况","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"那样做、处于前面所说的情况","pronunciation":["그러다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a3436f0078e154d2721.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.176,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=30837","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":116,"sequenceScore":3.0027,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["对不起，我最近就是莫名地容易烦躁。","听说以前要去国外的话，需要花很长时间呢。","你为什么无缘无故就对我发脾气啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对不起，我最近就是莫名地容易烦躁。","你为什么无缘无故就对我发脾气啊？","听说以前要去国外的话，需要花很长时间呢。"],"answer":0}]}
